{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105040/extras/ad38a29e3bc900a0c364209fed972676.avif?t=1769277652\" width=1501 height=376 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Russian Village Business</strong> is a simulator of a young entrepreneur in the Russian countryside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105040/extras/66fcc1013be84dce023bd69dc1229d19.poster.avif?t=1769277652\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105040/extras/66fcc1013be84dce023bd69dc1229d19.webm?t=1769277652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105040/extras/66fcc1013be84dce023bd69dc1229d19.mp4?t=1769277652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You open your first small shop in a remote village and try to establish trade in everything the locals might need \u2014 from bread and milk to soda and toilet paper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It all starts with a simple rural store, but over time you can grow your business, expand your inventory, and earn the respect of the locals. However, life in the countryside isn\u2019t just about work! You\u2019ll find plenty of activities and events around the map: take care of your property, help neighbors, go fishing, or just take a day off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105040/extras/782843897832bafa84f4fce037f46925.poster.avif?t=1769277652\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105040/extras/782843897832bafa84f4fce037f46925.webm?t=1769277652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105040/extras/782843897832bafa84f4fce037f46925.mp4?t=1769277652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game\u2019s world lives on its own \u2014 villagers visit your store, chat about news, ask for credit, and even haggle over prices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You decide your path: become an honest merchant, a cunning dealer, or just a \u201cgood guy\u201d everyone in the village knows and trusts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105040/extras/fd8f16c5f4f2249cc532fd82ad78e883.poster.avif?t=1769277652\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105040/extras/fd8f16c5f4f2249cc532fd82ad78e883.webm?t=1769277652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105040/extras/fd8f16c5f4f2249cc532fd82ad78e883.mp4?t=1769277652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Russian Village Business</strong> combines elements of a shop simulator, everyday life, and sandbox gameplay \u2014 all in the cozy, humorous, and familiar atmosphere of the Russian countryside.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4105040?t=1769277652","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105040/b0a076515d0d53eaf495e0ce0a925592170798f1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769277652","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105040/222613d9b1404a467305f105b00c654c25fe742b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769277652","capsule_imagev5":"https://sh